  dialogueId: BookDialoge
  lines:
  - speaker: Nero
    text: "So\u2026 you finally found it."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: You know this book?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Nero
    text: "I know what it can become\u2026 for the right person."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: And what is that supposed to mean?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Nero
    text: "That depends on whether you\u2019re curious\u2026 or careful."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Nero
    text: Most people carry answers in their hands and never dare to look.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
